@@ -15,3 +15,11 @@ The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 - **[React](https://react.dev/)**: Used for UI components.
 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## On-device article translation
+
+Open **Translate · On-device** on an article or teaser, select a language, and press **Translate**. Headlines, summaries, article text, and captions translate locally using the browser's `Translator` API. Language packs may need an initial download. Unsupported browsers or language pairs show an explanation and keep the original content readable. There is no remote translation fallback.
+
+**Show original** restores the English text and cancels any pending translation. Selecting another target always starts from the original English, preserving links, formatting, and code blocks. Controls initialize on client navigation and cancel pending work when removed.
+
+Run `pnpm test:translation` with Node.js 24+ for the automated DOM tests with a mocked Translator API. Run `pnpm build` for the production build. The DOM tests do not download models or validate model output quality.
